  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with the boiling water.\n• Add basmati rice and a pinch of salt and cook, uncovered, over high heat until tender, 12 mins. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6596291fb6e284551035bfa5-413f98df.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot and zucchini into half-moons. Thinly slice onion. Drain and rinse lentils.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook carrot, zucchini and onion, until tender, 4-5 mins.\n• Add tomato paste, curry spice blend, masala spice blend and drained lentils. Cook, until fragrant, 1-2 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6596291fb6e284551035bfa5-7931dffe.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium, then add cooking cream, the water, brown sugar and salt.\n• Stir to combine and simmer, until lentils are softened and curry is slightly thickened, 5-7 mins. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6596291fb6e284551035bfa5-9398dda2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rice and creamy Indian lentil curry between bowls. Top with flaked almonds.\n• Dollop with some yoghurt to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6596291fb6e284551035bfa5-92057450.jpeg"
    }
  ]
